<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  {{> head title="접수 완료"}}
</head>
<body>
  {{> header}}

  <main class="page">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <section class="complete">
        <div class="complete-mark" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="48" height="48"><path d="M11 25 L20 34 L37 15" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="square" /></svg>
        </div>
        {{#if isEmergency}}
          <h1 class="page-title">긴급 출동 요청이 접수되었습니다</h1>
        {{else}}
          <h1 class="page-title">접수가 완료되었습니다</h1>
        {{/if}}

        <dl class="receipt">
          <div class="receipt-row receipt-id">
            <dt>접수번호</dt>
            <dd>{{report.id}}</dd>
          </div>
          {{#if report.location}}
            <div class="receipt-row">
              <dt>발생 장소</dt>
              <dd>{{report.location}}</dd>
            </div>
          {{/if}}
          <div class="receipt-row">
            <dt>긴급도</dt>
            <dd>{{report.urgency}}</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="receipt-row">
            <dt>상태</dt>
            <dd>{{report.status}}</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>

        <div class="next-step{{#if isEmergency}} next-step-urgent{{/if}}">
          <p class="next-step-title">다음 단계</p>
          {{#if isEmergency}}
            <p>담당자가 곧 전화드립니다. 전화를 받을 수 있게 해주세요.</p>
          {{else}}
            <p>담당자가 곧 연락드리겠습니다.</p>
          {{/if}}
        </div>

        <div class="complete-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-dark btn-lg btn-block" href="tel:16442667"><span aria-hidden="true">📞</span> 1644-2667 전화하기</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline btn-lg btn-block" href="/">홈으로</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  {{> footer}}
</body>
</html>
